    "text": "I asked recently for restaurant recommendations in Berlin and I got some great suggestions. Ultimately I went with @kevinomdonnell’s shout for @stoke.berlin - a super cool yakitori / Japanese style spot. \n\nAs I was eating solo, I went à la carte, enjoying sashimi, negimi, incredibly tender duck hearts, potato and Ibérico pork. And of course I got primal with a wood-oven cooked hamachi collar. An excellent Negroni and wine suggestions rounded it all out. Love this kind of eating.\n\n#berlin #berlinfood",
